#### Interfaces

##### `Widget`

Interface with no constructor; instances come from make_widget

Passed as an **opaque object pointer** (`i32`), wrapped by a JS class. Constructors return an owned handle; methods pass the handle as the implicit leading `self` argument; `free()` releases the handle via the destroy symbol.

##### `weaveffi_edge_cases_Widget_refresh`

