#### Structs

##### `Leaf`

A plain JS object, serialized in a value buffer (`i32` ptr + `i32` len) at the boundary. Fields in declaration (wire) order:

| Field | Type |
|-------|------|
| `weight` | `f32` |

##### `Inner`

Middle layer of a three-deep struct nesting

A plain JS object, serialized in a value buffer (`i32` ptr + `i32` len) at the boundary. Fields in declaration (wire) order:

| Field | Type |
|-------|------|
| `leaf` | `Leaf` |
| `leaves` | `[Leaf]` |

##### `Outer`

A plain JS object, serialized in a value buffer (`i32` ptr + `i32` len) at the boundary. Fields in declaration (wire) order:

| Field | Type |
|-------|------|
| `inner` | `Inner` |
| `maybe_inner` | `Inner?` |
| `by_name` | `{string:Inner}` |
